+We use these statistics to understand how the website is used and to improve its pages and contact journeys. We set both services to record page views only, with no advertising or personalised-advertising features, Google signals, session recording, surveys, heatmaps or automatic capture of what you click, scroll or type, and we do not combine them with other information to identify you. Page addresses are sent without any query or fragment. When an analytics service loads, its provider receives your browser's technical information, including your IP address. The [Privacy Policy](/legal/privacy) explains what each provider receives, where it is processed and how long it is kept.
+
+Each service stays off until you choose to allow it. Choosing Reject optional, or making no choice, keeps both off. The website works in the same way whatever you choose, and our contact links remain available.
